  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "Arsinoitherium zitteli has two enormous side-by-side nasal horns and a smaller pair above the eyes. Skin, ears, horn covering and dimensions are estimates, not exact soft-tissue outlines preserved by fossil horn cores.",
    "zh": "重脚兽 Arsinoitherium zitteli 具有并列的两枚巨大鼻角及眼上方较小的一对角。皮肤、耳部、角表覆盖物与尺寸为估计，并非化石角芯保存的精确软组织轮廓。"
